#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots af dit ansigt, som Ubuntu Hello sammenlignes med. Hold mindst to, "
"optaget i forskellig belysning."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Viser gemte modeller for:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kun én ansigtsmodel er tilmeldt. Belysning ændrer, hvordan dit ansigt ser ud "
"til kameraet, så en enkelt model kan svigte om aftenen under lamper (eller i "
"dagslys). Tilføj en anden model optaget i andet lys for at forblive "
"pålidelig oplåsning på ethvert tidspunkt af dagen."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tilføj en anden model"

